.TH HALCYON-CTL 1 "2026-10-23" "Halcyon 0.1.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
halcyon-ctl \- control Halcyon desktop widgets
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B halcyon-ctl
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Control Halcyon from the terminal or a desktop shortcut.
Commands include start, stop, settings and focus.
Run
.B halcyon-ctl --help
for the complete command list and arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR halcyon (1)
.br
https://github.com/profilaz3/halcyon
